    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d21">

                <pb facs="0157" n="29" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg29"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.6212Anti-War/18</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1928</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received April 30.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3411</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Confirming my telegram No. 72 of April 13,
                    7 p.m.,<anchor n="34" xml:id="d21-f1"/> I have the honor to transmit herewith,
                    in copy and translation, Dr. Stresemann’s <pb facs="0158" n="30" xml:id="pg30"/>
                    formal acknowledgment of the receipt together with his reply to the Note
                    proposing a multilateral treaty to prevent war and its enclosures and the draft
                    treaty presented by me on the 13th instant.</p>
                <p>As stated in my telegram, Dr. Stresemann has requested that this communication
                    from him be not given to the press.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacob Gould
                    Schurman</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d21-a1.xml" xpointer="d21-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d21-a2.xml" xpointer="d21-a2"/>
            </div>
